

/*!
@defgroup edma eDMA: Enhanced Direct Memory Access (eDMA) Controller Driver
@details The MCUXpresso SDK provides a peripheral driver for the enhanced Direct Memory Access (eDMA)
         of MCUXpresso SDK devices.

@note This is the unified eDMA driver serving the eDMA3, eDMA4 and eDMA5 IP versions.
      Its Kconfig component is @c driver.edma_unified; the historical @c driver.edma4
      component is retained as a deprecated alias. This is why a device whose IP is
      eDMA3 (for example an "edma3" driver example) correctly enables the unified
      component rather than a version-specific one. The @c edma4_* / @c edma5_*
      identifiers inside the driver name the IP-specific TCD layout, not the component.

# Typical use case{#EDMATypicalUseCase}

## eDMA Operation{#EDMAOper}

Refer to the driver examples codes located at \<SDK_ROOT\>/boards/\<BOARD\>/driver_examples/edma*/

/*!
@defgroup edma_core eDMA core Driver
@ingroup edma
*/

/*!
@defgroup edma_soc eDMA soc Driver
@ingroup edma
*/
